1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,119
B, zero.

2
00:00:01,119 --> 00:00:07,252
A node never moves, so no work is done across it, and no energy can cross.

3
00:00:07,252 --> 00:00:11,888
The energy only sloshes back and forth between the neighbouring nodes.

4
00:00:11,888 --> 00:00:16,106
That is exactly why a stationary wave does not transport energy.

